<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>能量療癒 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E7%99%82%E7%99%92/</link><description>Recent content in 能量療癒 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E7%99%82%E7%99%92/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>脈輪失衡怎麼理解？七個自我覺察提問</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</link><pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;最近睡不好、容易焦慮，會不會是「某個脈輪失衡」？先別急著替身體找靈性答案。**脈輪是文化與自我反思的框架，不是診斷工具。**頭痛、疼痛、失眠、情緒低落等情況，都不能靠勾選清單判定成哪一輪出了問題。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪完整入門：七輪象徵、顏色與日常提問</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想認識脈輪，先記住一件事：**七輪是一張理解自身經驗的象徵地圖，不是身體檢查表。**你可以用它整理安全感、關係或表達上的困惑，卻不能靠「哪一輪不舒服」推斷疾病。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>